{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "kind": "topic-article-purpose",
  "notes": [
    "统一合同 key：purpose / article_length / structure_id（与 basic.* 对齐）",
    "UI 标签可只写短篇/中篇/长篇；model_guide 注入主笔，约束档位体量下限（不钉死绝对字数）",
    "fiction_short / drama_beat：长篇仍是单次一次读完，≠ series 连载"
  ],
